l combos that send enemies flying and carve your name into heavy metal HIGH SCORE HISTORY! \n\nPlay 8 original tracks in 4 difficulty modes, across 6 unique levels.", "short_description": "Are you ready to rock!? Boss Music Games and VYERSOFT Corp present God of Riffs: an EPIC, adrenaline pumping, heavy metal VR rhythm game that's like a hard rock album cover come to life! \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.godofriffs.com/gorprivacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Vyersoft Corp", "support_website_url": "https://bossmusicgames.com/", "website_url": "https://www.godofriffs.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["MUSIC"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "479031400546957"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 17, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1989012845055830"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1443558434029651"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2446152455788122"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "920437940466825"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1644124383239370"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "782816841480397"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1705596637511954"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3250987521709610"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1308286986961101"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1634349197387828"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "446137661740779"}, {"stat